PTX MP+mbarrier-expect-complete-tx
"Phase completion needs both the arrival and the tx-count: P0 arrives with expect_tx 1, P1 completes the transaction with mbarrier.complete_tx (a relaxed operation, 24353). P2's wait returns True only after both; P0's write is ordered by its release arrive. Expected: forbidden."
{
b=mbarrier(1) @cta 0;
x=0;
P2:r0=0;
P2:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                   | P1@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0              | P2@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                       ;
 st.weak x, 1                               | mbarrier.complete_tx.relaxed.cta b, 1 | mbarrier.test_wait.parity.acquire.cta r0, b, 0 ;
 mbarrier.arrive.expect_tx.release.cta b, 1 |                                       | ld.weak r1, x                                  ;
exists
(P2:r0 == 1 /\ P2:r1 == 0)
